{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18666","headline":"首春逢耕者 · 柳宗元","name":"首春逢耕者","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南楚春候早，余寒已滋荣。\n土膏释原埜，百蛰竞所营。\n缀景未及郊，穑人先耦耕。\n园林幽鸟啭，渚泽新泉清。\n农事诚素务，羁囚阻平生。\n故池想芜没，遗亩当榛荆。\n慕隐既有系，图功遂无成。\n聊从田父言，款曲陈此情。\n眷然抚耒耜，回首烟云横。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"柳宗元","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18666.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18666","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}